E268                             ; "-" has two jobs: directly before a digit it starts a negative number.
E268                             ; (The checked build has it in the tail, near negnum: its report would be
E268                             ; in the way here.)
E268                          IF   1-CHECKED   
                    H_SUB:    JSR   isdig   
                              BLO   negnum   
                              LDD   2,U   
                              SUBD   ,U++   
                              BRA   st   
